{"ID":"20230927160414-521jnq2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927160414-521jnq2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160414-521jnq2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160418-wa43396\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160418-z64syke\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927160418-z64syke\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:129,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:129\u0026#125;","title":"【川穹茶调散】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927160418"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927160418-wa43396","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160418-wa43396","updated":"20230927160418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川穹茶调散组成：川穹、荆芥（去梗）各四两，白芷、羌活、甘草（炙）各二两，细辛（去芦）一两，防风（去芦）一两半，薄荷叶（不见火）八两。"}]},{"ID":"20230927160418-4qfn8jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160418-4qfn8jk","updated":"20230927160418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上为细末。每服二钱，每日二次，食后清茶调下。"}]},{"ID":"20230927160418-z64syke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927160418-z64syke","updated":"20230927160418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本方为治疗风邪外袭所致头痛有效方。方中川穹善治少阳、厥阴头痛；羌活善治太阳经头痛；白芷善治阳明经头痛；细辛、薄荷、荆芥、防风辛散 上行以疏散风邪，止头痛之功。此方以川穹为主药而制成散剂，用茶清调服，治风邪上犯头目，阻遏清阳之头痛有卓著的疗效，故名川穹茶调散。"}]}]}